# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Added Emerald on a Stick:
    - 25 Durability points
    - Villagers follow the player holding it
    - Right Clicking it costs durability and lets the Villagers jump
    - Can be enchanted with Unbreaking to lower the chance of the item being damaged
    - Villagers following don't take damage on Magma Blocks
    - Villagers standing on Honey Blocks do not follow players


## Fixes:
